ducible-local-ring", "owner_tag": "0DQG", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14"}, "policy_hash": "sha256:9ad00686dd2253c6ab6248bc9019c435d094832baa3fbf1faeba8adf187ec4e5", "source_label": "stacks-properties-section-irreducible-local-ring", "usage": "p0-locked-math-frame", "usage_source": {"after": "n", "before": "A", "environments": []}}, "command": "text", "policy_entry": "p0-frame-stacks-properties-01", "slot_byte_span": {"end": 66, "start": 62}, "slot_id": "math/0001/text/0002", "source": " is "}], "source": "$$\nP_n(A) = \\text{the number of geometric branches of }A\\text{ is }n\n$$", "source_byte_span": {"end": 389, "start": 318}, "source_hash": "sha256:d768526b646548e7075c65818854af83168b567dc14e78fcfd532d7957b90e9e"}], "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "0DQG", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "MATHSEG_0001": "$$\nP_n(A) = \\text{", "MATHSEG_0002": "}A\\text{", "MATHSEG_0003": "}n\n$$", "MATH_0001": "$n \\in \\mathbf{N}$", "MATH_0002": "$A$", "MATH_0003": "$A \\to B$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathfrak q$", "MATH_0005": "$B$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathfrak p$", "MATH_0007": "$A$", "MATH_0008": "$$\nP_n(A_\\mathfrak p) \\Leftrightarrow P_n(B_\\mathfrak q)\n$$", "MATH_0009": "$P_n$", "MATH_0010": "$\\mathcal{P}_n$", "MATH_0011": "$(U, u)$", "MATH_0012": "$\\mathcal{P}_n(U, u) = P_n(\\mathcal{O}_{U, u})$", "MATH_0013": "$\\mathcal{P}_n$", "MATH_0014": "$X$", "MATH_0015": "$x$", "MATH_0016": "$X$", "MATH_0017": "$x$", "MATH_0018": "$n$", "MATH_0019": "$\\mathcal{P}_n$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{properties-section-unibranch}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{spaces-properties-section-irreducible-local-ring}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{more-algebra-lemma-invariance-number-branches-smooth}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{spaces-properties-remark-list-properties-local-ring-local-etale-topology}", "REF_0005": "\\ref{spaces-properties-definition-property-at-point}", "REF_0006": "\\ref{spaces-properties-definition-number-of-geometric-branches}", "REF_0007": "\\ref{descent-definition-local-at-point}", "REF_0008": "\\ref{more-morphisms-lemma-number-of-branches-and-smooth}", "REF_0009": "\\ref{definition-property-at-point}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 2, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:8d46b66548746ead7dace3080f5479e0afe1ced6f278b7254c256c466fc44075", "source_math_skeleton_hash": "sha256:e6aa8cd240000242d9455927583d71fec1c5318432d905b48309c5357875d9ff", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:23fd064274c588fbff17692cfdd4c32010b83bb1dc9ddee1ecd17a0f426cc3cc", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nWe have defined the geometric number of branches of a scheme at a point\nin Properties, Section <REF_0001>\nand for an algebraic space at a point in Properties of Spaces, Section\n<REF_0002>.\nLet <MATH_0001>. For a local ring <MATH_0002> set\n<MATHSEG_0001>the number of geometric branches of <MATHSEG_0002> is <MATHSEG_0003>\nFor a smooth ring map <MATH_0003> and a prime ideal <MATH_0004>\nof <MATH_0005> lying over <MATH_0006> of <MATH_0007> we have\n<MATH_0008>\nby More on Algebra, Lemma\n<REF_0003>.\nAs in Properties of Spaces, Remark\n<REF_0004>\nwe may use <MATH_0009> to define an <ACCENT_0001>tale local property <MATH_0010>\nof germs <MATH_0011> of schemes by setting\n<MATH_0012>.\nThe corresponding property <MATH_0013>\nof an algebraic space <MATH_0014> at a point <MATH_0015>\n(see Properties of Spaces, Definition\n<REF_0005>)\nis just the property\n``the number of geometric branches of <MATH_0016> at <MATH_0017> is <MATH_0018>'', see\nProperties of Spaces, Definition\n<REF_0006>.\nMoreover, the property <MATH_0019> is smooth local, see\nDescent, Definition <REF_0007>.\nThis follows either from the equivalence displayed above\nor More on Morphisms, Lemma\n<REF_0008>.\nThus Definition <REF_0009>\napplies and we obtain a notion for algebraic stacks at a point.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:eba543b44f745bf49a0b7f068e577293b91150629042307fd1c1f404ba79c3f3", "unit_id": "tag:0DQG:prose-0001"}
